# Canonical public origin = the Cloudflare Pages app, which owns the /api gateway and its
# 4-Render role routing. Never point this at a *.onrender.com host: Render 1 is suspended and
# the standbys answer mutations with `standby_read_only`.
# lib/apiBase.ts also guards against stale values, so an old file here cannot break the app.
EXPO_PUBLIC_DOMAIN=trynex-lifestyle-shop.pages.dev
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://trynex-lifestyle-shop.pages.dev
